  "text": "## Template 10: KYC Document Request  \n**Subject:** Action Needed: Please Provide Your Identity Documents  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nWe need you to provide some documentation to complete your account\nverification (KYC - Know Your Customer).\n\nWhat We Need:\nChoose one:\n- UK Passport (copy is fine)\n- UK Driving License (copy is fine)\n\nPLUS one of these for your address:\n- Utility bill (dated within 3 months)\n- Council tax letter\n- Bank statement\n\nHow to Submit:\n1. Upload securely: www.firstuk.bank/kyc-upload\n2. Email: kyc@firstuk.bank\n3. Visit a branch in person\n\nDeadline: [date - typically 30 days]\n\nWhy This Matters:\nRegulatory requirements ensure we're banking responsibly and\nprotecting your account.\n\nQuestions?\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n\nThank you for your cooperation!\n\nFirstUK Bank Compliance Team\n```  \n---",
